Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:18:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ptm: log who sets the notification LED and to what

The real news module sets the blue LED through ptm:sysm SetInfoLEDPattern. These calls were
not logged, so a LED that does not blink could not be told apart from a module that never asks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
---
 BUILD-NUMBER                     |  2 +-
 src/core/hle/service/ptm/ptm.cpp | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

